---
/** The live questions list (MM-85). An empty shell: everything inside it is
 *  written by the workshop page's script from the `questions` events on
 *  /api/questions/stream/, so the built page carries no question at all and
 *  stays as cacheable as the rest of the site.
 *
 *  The Covered group is the host's own view. It stays hidden for everyone
 *  else — a participant never sees a covered question, neither in the list nor
 *  in this group. */
---

<div class="questions flow" data-questions>
  <p class="questions__count" data-questions-count>No questions yet</p>
  <ol class="questions__list" data-questions-list></ol>
  <details class="questions__covered" data-questions-covered hidden>
    <summary>Covered</summary>
    <ol></ol>
  </details>
</div>
